    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe’s weapon cuts through a lower floating rib to gash your liver. Internal bleeding and any resulting infection may be the end of your misspent existence.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (1) which can only be removed by Surgery. Make a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test; failure means you contract @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.M8XyRs9DN12XsFTQ]{Blood Rot}, otherwise gaining a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound}.</p>"
